Equivariant-Invariant Representation Learning with Transformation-Conditioned Hypernetworks

This repository contains research code developed for equivariant and invariant representation learning across continuous 3D rotations, vehicle viewpoints, and discrete domain shifts.

Portions of this software are derived from the official implementation of:
"Self-Supervised Equivariant and Invariant Representation Learning (SIE)"
by Quentin Garrido, Laurent Najman, and Yann LeCun (ICML 2023),
originally licensed by Meta Platforms, Inc. under the terms specified in the respective source files.
