Modifications and new research components:
- Learned Transformation Encoder conditioning Hypernetworks without ground-truth transformation parameters at test time.
- Continuous 3D rotation quaternion transformation estimation for 3DIEBench.
- Vehicle viewpoint transformation estimation for VeRi-776.
- Discrete categorical Day/Night domain shift transformation estimation and Identity-Balanced Supervised Contrastive Learning (Identity SupCon) for DN-348.
